	measure 'KPI AG Monthly Savings' = ```
			
			VAR _CurrentM = [AG Total]
			VAR _LastYear = [AG Total Last Year]
			VAR Difference = _CurrentM - _LastYear
			
			RETURN Difference * 0.77 * 0.74 * 142
			
			```
